edit(DOSSIER, """Given the regularity of P2, holding one's effects is equivalent to everything downstream of one's acts being alike to oneself (`«本类常则闭当且仅当后皆同类»`), and neither premise can be dropped (`Unclosed.not_taken_in`, `Inconstant.not_all_follow`, `Inconstant.not_constant_at`). Quote [theories/becoming/chapters/07-SIGNIFICANCE.md]: "So the reach rests on one premise, holding one's effects, carried on by the regularity." """,
     """The reach is exactly that everything downstream of one's acts is alike to oneself, with no regularity assumed: that the class of one's line hold the effects of oneself and of each stage of one's line (`«后皆续当且仅当后皆同类»`, `«后皆续当且仅当自与线皆闭»`, root theorems). P4 is its first step and cannot be dropped (`«后皆续则所缘同于»`, `Unclosed.not_taken_in`); given the regularity of P2, holding one's effects is equivalent to the reach (`«本类常则闭当且仅当后皆同类»`), and without the regularity holding one's effects need give nothing beyond the first step (`Inconstant.not_all_follow`, `Inconstant.not_constant_at`). But the regularity is not needed: a class can meet the path's need without it, and, given P4 and acting, the regularity gives more, the holding of the effects of every occurrence alike to oneself, on one's line or not (`OtherLeaves.reach_without_condition`, `OtherLeaves.other_not_held`, `«本类常闭则所缘同类»`). Quote [theories/becoming/chapters/07-SIGNIFICANCE.md]: "So what the path needs of P2 and P4 is one thing, that the class of one's line hold the effects of oneself and of each stage of one's line; P4 is its first step, and P2 one regularity that carries that step on." """)

# P-20: standing and use
edit(DOSSIER, """if P2 fails, it is reached only where everything downstream of one's acts happens to be alike to oneself, and otherwise rests on the step.""",
     """if P2 fails, it is reached exactly where the class of one's line still holds the effects of oneself and of each stage of one's line (`«后皆续当且仅当自与线皆闭»`, as in `OtherLeaves`), never where one's line ends while its last stage still conditions something (`«亡而网续则后不皆续»`), and otherwise rests on the step.""")

